<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Thank you from the Compound. Team</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,300;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,600&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;1,9..40,400&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--v:#6D28D9;--vm:#7C3AED;--vl:#8B5CF6;--vp:#EDE9FE;--ink:#0D0D0D;--white:#fff;--ff:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;--fb:'DM Sans',sans-serif;--fm:'DM Mono',monospace;--ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}html,body{height:100%;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
body{font-family:var(--fb);background:var(--ink);color:var(--white);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh;padding:2rem;text-align:center;overflow:hidden}
.bg-glow{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 50% 50%,rgba(109,40,217,.18) 0%,transparent 70%)}
.tag{font-family:var(--fm);font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);margin-bottom:2rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.mark{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-bottom:2.5rem}
.c-svg{width:180px;height:180px;overflow:visible}
@keyframes ad1{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@keyframes ad2{to{transform:rotate(-360deg)}}
@keyframes gp{0%,100%{opacity:.6;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.3)}}
@keyframes ck{0%{stroke-dashoffset:60}100%{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
.hl{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.5vw,4.2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--white);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:.95;margin-bottom:.85rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.hl em{font-style:italic;color:var(--vl)}
.sub{font-size:1rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.42);line-height:1.72;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto 2.25rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.detail{font-family:var(--fm);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.22);margin-bottom:2.5rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
.acts{display:flex;gap:.85rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;z-index:1}
.btn-h{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;background:var(--v);color:var(--white);padding:.85rem 1.75rem;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s}.btn-h:hover{background:var(--vm);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(109,40,217,.45)}
.btn-s{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);padding:.83rem 1.75rem;border-radius:8px;font-weight:500;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);transition:all .2s}.btn-s:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-glow"></div>
<div class="tag">Message received</div>
<div class="mark">
  <svg class="c-svg" viewBox="0 0 180 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs><radialGradient id="g" cx="65%" cy="50%" r="30%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#7C3AED" stop-opacity=".7"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#7C3AED" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>
    <ellipse cx="117" cy="90" rx="34" ry="46" fill="url(#g)" style="animation:gp 3.5s ease-in-out infinite"/>
    <g style="transform-origin:90px 90px;animation:ad1 55s linear infinite;opacity:.12"><path d="M90,14 A76,76 0 1 1 90,166" stroke="#6D28D9" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
    <g style="transform-origin:90px 90px;animation:ad2 38s linear infinite;opacity:.19"><path d="M90,26 A64,64 0 1 1 90,154" stroke="#7C3AED" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
    <g style="transform-origin:90px 90px;animation:ad1 28s linear infinite;opacity:.28"><path d="M90,42 A48,48 0 1 1 90,138" stroke="#6D28D9" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
    <g style="transform-origin:90px 90px;animation:ad2 20s linear infinite;opacity:.42"><path d="M90,58 A32,32 0 1 1 90,122" stroke="#8B5CF6" stroke-width="2.2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
    <g style="transform-origin:90px 90px;animation:ad1 13s linear infinite;opacity:.6"><path d="M90,74 A16,16 0 1 1 90,106" stroke="#7C3AED" stroke-width="2.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
    <!-- Checkmark in the centre -->
    <polyline points="76,90 85,100 106,78" stroke="#8B5CF6" stroke-width="3.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="60" stroke-dashoffset="60" style="animation:ck .55s ease .25s forwards"/>
  </svg>
</div>
<h1 class="hl">We have got <em>your message.</em></h1>
<p class="sub">Someone from our team will be in touch within 24 hours. If it is urgent, reach us directly at <a href="mailto:info@compounddigital.co" style="color:var(--vl);text-decoration:none">info@compounddigital.co</a>.</p>
<p class="detail">Response within 24 hours &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Business days</p>
<div class="acts">
  <a href="index.html" class="btn-h">Back to home &rarr;</a>
  <a href="work.html" class="btn-s">See our work</a>
</div>
</body></html>
